<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <Pyrophobia.stages.afraid_of_fire.label>怕火</Pyrophobia.stages.afraid_of_fire.label>
  <Pyrophobia.stages.afraid_of_fire.description>火焰让我如此紧张。那样灼热的高温——我觉得它随时会扑向我！</Pyrophobia.stages.afraid_of_fire.description>
  <Bloodfeeder_ReveredBloodfeeder.stages.revered_bloodfeeder.label>受崇敬的噬血者</Bloodfeeder_ReveredBloodfeeder.stages.revered_bloodfeeder.label>
  <Bloodfeeder_ReveredBloodfeeder.stages.revered_bloodfeeder.description>让他们崇拜我吧。以他们为食使我位于他们之上，正如动物位于人类之下。</Bloodfeeder_ReveredBloodfeeder.stages.revered_bloodfeeder.description>
  <Bloodfeeder_ReviledBloodfeeder.stages.bloodfeeder_self_hatred.label>噬血者的自我憎恨</Bloodfeeder_ReviledBloodfeeder.stages.bloodfeeder_self_hatred.label>
  <Bloodfeeder_ReviledBloodfeeder.stages.bloodfeeder_self_hatred.description>我就是我所憎恨的东西。我必须摆脱这个诅咒。</Bloodfeeder_ReviledBloodfeeder.stages.bloodfeeder_self_hatred.description>
  <BloodfeederColonist_Revered.stages.no_bloodfeeders.label>没有噬血者</BloodfeederColonist_Revered.stages.no_bloodfeeders.label>
  <BloodfeederColonist_Revered.stages.no_bloodfeeders.description>没有噬血者主人，我们便无人指引、迷失方向。我们应当让一位噬血者成为我们的领袖。</BloodfeederColonist_Revered.stages.no_bloodfeeders.description>
  <BloodfeederColonist_Revered.stages.no_bloodfeeder_master.label>没有噬血者主人</BloodfeederColonist_Revered.stages.no_bloodfeeder_master.label>
  <BloodfeederColonist_Revered.stages.no_bloodfeeder_master.description>没有噬血者主人，我们缺乏正确的方向。我们应当让一位噬血者成为我们的领袖。</BloodfeederColonist_Revered.stages.no_bloodfeeder_master.description>
  <BloodfeederColonist_Revered.stages.bloodfeeder_master.label>噬血者主人</BloodfeederColonist_Revered.stages.bloodfeeder_master.label>
  <BloodfeederColonist_Revered.stages.bloodfeeder_master.description>噬血者的存在是极大的荣耀。愿他们永生。</BloodfeederColonist_Revered.stages.bloodfeeder_master.description>
  <BloodfeederColonist_Reviled.stages.bloodfeeder_among_us.label>噬血者在我们之中</BloodfeederColonist_Reviled.stages.bloodfeeder_among_us.label>
  <BloodfeederColonist_Reviled.stages.bloodfeeder_among_us.description>他们中的一个走在我们中间。我们应当把噬血者逐出我们的家园。</BloodfeederColonist_Reviled.stages.bloodfeeder_among_us.description>
  <BloodfeederDied_Revered.stages.bloodfeeder_died.label>噬血者死亡</BloodfeederDied_Revered.stages.bloodfeeder_died.label>
  <BloodfeederDied_Revered.stages.bloodfeeder_died.description>噬血者位于我们之上，却有一位死在了这里。我们肯定会因此受到惩罚。</BloodfeederDied_Revered.stages.bloodfeeder_died.description>
  <BloodfeederDied_Reviled.stages.bloodfeeder_died.label>噬血者死亡</BloodfeederDied_Reviled.stages.bloodfeeder_died.label>
  <BloodfeederDied_Reviled.stages.bloodfeeder_died.description>唯一好的噬血者就是死掉的噬血者。</BloodfeederDied_Reviled.stages.bloodfeeder_died.description>
  <Bloodfeeders_Revered_Opinion_Bloodfeeder.stages.bloodfeeder.label>噬血者</Bloodfeeders_Revered_Opinion_Bloodfeeder.stages.bloodfeeder.label>
  <Bloodfeeders_Reviled_Opinion_Bloodfeeder.stages.bloodfeeder.label>噬血者</Bloodfeeders_Reviled_Opinion_Bloodfeeder.stages.bloodfeeder.label>
  <ChildLabor_Encouraged_ChildAssignedRecreation.stages.children_assigned_recreation.label>儿童被分配娱乐</ChildLabor_Encouraged_ChildAssignedRecreation.stages.children_assigned_recreation.label>
  <ChildLabor_Encouraged_ChildAssignedRecreation.stages.children_assigned_recreation.description>我们为什么要让孩子把青春浪费在游戏上？</ChildLabor_Encouraged_ChildAssignedRecreation.stages.children_assigned_recreation.description>
  <ChildLabor_Encouraged_ChildAssignedWork.stages.children_assigned_work.label>儿童被分配工作</ChildLabor_Encouraged_ChildAssignedWork.stages.children_assigned_work.label>
  <ChildLabor_Encouraged_ChildAssignedWork.stages.children_assigned_work.description>看到孩子被迫工作是件令人不快的事。他们只有一次童年。</ChildLabor_Encouraged_ChildAssignedWork.stages.children_assigned_work.description>
  <GrowthVat_Essential_ChildNotInGrowthVat.stages.child_not_in_growth_vat.label>孩子不在成长舱中</GrowthVat_Essential_ChildNotInGrowthVat.stages.child_not_in_growth_vat.label>
  <GrowthVat_Essential_ChildNotInGrowthVat.stages.child_not_in_growth_vat.description>我的孩子到处跑让我感到不安。他们应该在成长舱里安全地成长。</GrowthVat_Essential_ChildNotInGrowthVat.stages.child_not_in_growth_vat.description>
  <GrowthVat_Essential_Pregnant.stages.natural_pregnancy.label>自然怀孕</GrowthVat_Essential_Pregnant.stages.natural_pregnancy.label>
  <GrowthVat_Essential_Pregnant.stages.natural_pregnancy.description>分娩是个可怕的想法。我们应该有成长舱来安全地养育我们的孩子。</GrowthVat_Essential_Pregnant.stages.natural_pregnancy.description>
  <GrowthVat_Prohibited_ChildInGrowthVat.stages.my_child_is_in_a_growth_vat.label>我的孩子在成长舱中</GrowthVat_Prohibited_ChildInGrowthVat.stages.my_child_is_in_a_growth_vat.label>
  <GrowthVat_Prohibited_ChildInGrowthVat.stages.my_child_is_in_a_growth_vat.description>想到我的孩子漂浮在那台可怕的机器里，我就受不了。</GrowthVat_Prohibited_ChildInGrowthVat.stages.my_child_is_in_a_growth_vat.description>
  <GrowthVat_Prohibited_ChildNotInGrowthVat.stages.child_not_in_growth_vat.label>孩子不在成长舱中</GrowthVat_Prohibited_ChildNotInGrowthVat.stages.child_not_in_growth_vat.label>
  <GrowthVat_Prohibited_ChildNotInGrowthVat.stages.child_not_in_growth_vat.description>我很高兴看到我的孩子能像个孩子。他们的童年太珍贵了，不该浪费在缸里。</GrowthVat_Prohibited_ChildNotInGrowthVat.stages.child_not_in_growth_vat.description>
  <GrowthVat_Prohibited_GrowthVatInColony.stages.growth_vat.label>成长舱</GrowthVat_Prohibited_GrowthVatInColony.stages.growth_vat.label>
  <GrowthVat_Prohibited_GrowthVatInColony.stages.growth_vat.description>想到那台可怕的成长舱在我们殖民地，我就厌恶。</GrowthVat_Prohibited_GrowthVatInColony.stages.growth_vat.description>
  <PreferredXenotype.stages.preferred_xenotype.label>偏好的异种</PreferredXenotype.stages.preferred_xenotype.label>
  <PreferredXenotype.stages.disliked_xenotype.label>不喜欢的异种</PreferredXenotype.stages.disliked_xenotype.label>
  <PreferredXenotypeMakeup.stages.all_preferred_xenotypes.label>全是偏好异种</PreferredXenotypeMakeup.stages.all_preferred_xenotypes.label>
  <PreferredXenotypeMakeup.stages.all_preferred_xenotypes.description>我们建立了一个只有优秀而强壮的异种的社群。</PreferredXenotypeMakeup.stages.all_preferred_xenotypes.description>
  <PreferredXenotypeMakeup.stages.some_disliked_xenotypes.label>一些不喜欢的异种</PreferredXenotypeMakeup.stages.some_disliked_xenotypes.label>
  <PreferredXenotypeMakeup.stages.some_disliked_xenotypes.description>那些异种在我们的社群里。我不想让他们在这里。</PreferredXenotypeMakeup.stages.some_disliked_xenotypes.description>
  <PreferredXenotypeMakeup.stages.many_disliked_xenotypes.label>许多不喜欢的异种</PreferredXenotypeMakeup.stages.many_disliked_xenotypes.label>
  <PreferredXenotypeMakeup.stages.many_disliked_xenotypes.description>我们社群里这样的异种太多了。他们不该在这里。</PreferredXenotypeMakeup.stages.many_disliked_xenotypes.description>
  <PreferredXenotypeMakeup.stages.tons_of_disliked_xenotypes.label>大量不喜欢的异种</PreferredXenotypeMakeup.stages.tons_of_disliked_xenotypes.label>
  <PreferredXenotypeMakeup.stages.tons_of_disliked_xenotypes.description>我被那些异种包围着。他们不属于这里。</PreferredXenotypeMakeup.stages.tons_of_disliked_xenotypes.description>
  <SelfDislikedXenotype.stages.I_am_disliked_xenotype.label>我是不被喜欢的异种</SelfDislikedXenotype.stages.I_am_disliked_xenotype.label>
  <SelfDislikedXenotype.stages.I_am_disliked_xenotype.description>我是个{XENOTYPENAME}。我不是那些好的类型之一。</SelfDislikedXenotype.stages.I_am_disliked_xenotype.description>
  <CryingBaby.stages.baby_crying.label>婴儿啼哭</CryingBaby.stages.baby_crying.label>
  <CryingBaby.stages.baby_crying.description>那刺耳的嚎哭声真让人烦躁！</CryingBaby.stages.baby_crying.description>
  <GigglingBaby.stages.baby_giggling.label>婴儿咯咯笑</GigglingBaby.stages.baby_giggling.label>
  <GigglingBaby.stages.baby_giggling.description>一个咯咯笑的婴儿就能让我脸上浮现笑容。</GigglingBaby.stages.baby_giggling.description>
  <MyCryingBaby.stages.my_baby_is_crying.label>我的婴儿在哭</MyCryingBaby.stages.my_baby_is_crying.label>
  <MyCryingBaby.stages.my_baby_is_crying.description>我的孩子哭了。我希望它快点停下来。</MyCryingBaby.stages.my_baby_is_crying.description>
  <MyGigglingBaby.stages.my_baby_giggling.label>我的婴儿咯咯笑</MyGigglingBaby.stages.my_baby_giggling.label>
  <MyGigglingBaby.stages.my_baby_giggling.description>我的孩子是智人圈里最可爱的！</MyGigglingBaby.stages.my_baby_giggling.description>
  <KilledChild.stages.killed_a_child.label>杀了一个孩子</KilledChild.stages.killed_a_child.label>
  <KilledChild.stages.killed_a_child.description>杀掉这么年幼的生命感觉是错的，无论情形如何。</KilledChild.stages.killed_a_child.description>
  <KilledMyBirthMother.stages.killed_my_birth_mother.label>杀了我的生母</KilledMyBirthMother.stages.killed_my_birth_mother.label>
  <MyBirthMotherDied.stages.my_birth_mother_died.label>我的生母{0}去世了</MyBirthMotherDied.stages.my_birth_mother_died.label>
  <MyBirthMotherDied.stages.my_birth_mother_died.description>我的生母去世了。她永远消失了。就像我的生命中有了一个洞。</MyBirthMotherDied.stages.my_birth_mother_died.description>
  <MyBirthMotherLost.stages.my_birth_mother_lost.label>我的生母{0}失踪了</MyBirthMotherLost.stages.my_birth_mother_lost.label>
  <MyBirthMotherLost.stages.my_birth_mother_lost.description>我的生母失踪了。我希望她有一天能回到我们身边。</MyBirthMotherLost.stages.my_birth_mother_lost.description>
  <AteBabyFood.stages.ate_baby_food.label>吃了婴儿食品</AteBabyFood.stages.ate_baby_food.label>
  <AteBabyFood.stages.ate_baby_food.description>我不得不吃为幼儿做的稀糊。它不只是没味道，还让人感到羞辱。</AteBabyFood.stages.ate_baby_food.description>
  <FedOn_Social.stages.fed_on.label>被吸血</FedOn_Social.stages.fed_on.label>
  <GaveLesson.stages.listened_to_my_lesson.label>听了我的课</GaveLesson.stages.listened_to_my_lesson.label>
  <WasTaught.stages.taught_me_a_skill.label>教了我一项技能</WasTaught.stages.taught_me_a_skill.label>
  <BabyBorn.stages.was_born_healthy.label>{0}健康出生</BabyBorn.stages.was_born_healthy.label>
  <BabyBorn.stages.was_born_healthy.description>我的孩子带给我如此多的喜悦。为了我的小宝贝，我愿意移山填海。</BabyBorn.stages.was_born_healthy.description>
  <FedOn.stages.fed_on_by.label>被{0}吸血</FedOn.stages.fed_on_by.label>
  <FedOn.stages.fed_on_by.description>我像一个家畜一样被噬血者侵犯了。</FedOn.stages.fed_on_by.description>
  <IngestedHemogenPack.stages.ingested_hemogen_pack.label>摄入了血原质包</IngestedHemogenPack.stages.ingested_hemogen_pack.label>
  <IngestedHemogenPack.stages.ingested_hemogen_pack.description>我摄入了一包血原质。它也许能让我活命，但绝对令人恶心。</IngestedHemogenPack.stages.ingested_hemogen_pack.description>
  <Miscarried.stages.miscarried.label>流产</Miscarried.stages.miscarried.label>
  <Miscarried.stages.miscarried.description>我失去了我的孩子。</Miscarried.stages.miscarried.description>
  <PartnerMiscarried.stages.miscarried.label>{0}流产了</PartnerMiscarried.stages.miscarried.label>
  <PartnerMiscarried.stages.miscarried.description>我孩子的故事还没开始就结束了。</PartnerMiscarried.stages.miscarried.description>
  <PregnancyEnded.stages.pregnancy_ended.label>怀孕结束</PregnancyEnded.stages.pregnancy_ended.label>
  <PregnancyEnded.stages.pregnancy_ended.description>我松了一口气，我不再怀孕了。</PregnancyEnded.stages.pregnancy_ended.description>
  <PsychicBondTorn.stages.psychic_bond_torn.label>灵能羁绊断裂（{0}）</PsychicBondTorn.stages.psychic_bond_torn.label>
  <PsychicBondTorn.stages.psychic_bond_torn.description>我与{OTHERPAWN}的灵能羁绊被撕裂了。我感觉自己的一部分心智与情感缺失了。</PsychicBondTorn.stages.psychic_bond_torn.description>
  <Stillbirth.stages.stillbirth.label>死产</Stillbirth.stages.stillbirth.label>
  <Stillbirth.stages.stillbirth.description>我的孩子在分娩中死了。</Stillbirth.stages.stillbirth.description>
  <XenogermHarvested_Prisoner.stages.genes_harvested.label>基因被摘取</XenogermHarvested_Prisoner.stages.genes_harvested.label>
  <XenogermHarvested_Prisoner.stages.genes_harvested.description>他们提取了我的基因，就好像我是什么实验室生物。</XenogermHarvested_Prisoner.stages.genes_harvested.description>
  <MoodOffsetHappy.stages.genetic_optimism.label>基因乐观</MoodOffsetHappy.stages.genetic_optimism.label>
  <MoodOffsetHappy.stages.genetic_optimism.description>“快乐”基因带来的天然加成。</MoodOffsetHappy.stages.genetic_optimism.description>
  <MoodOffsetUnhappy.stages.genetic_pessimism.label>基因悲观</MoodOffsetUnhappy.stages.genetic_pessimism.label>
  <MoodOffsetUnhappy.stages.genetic_pessimism.description>“不快乐”基因带来的天然惩罚。</MoodOffsetUnhappy.stages.genetic_pessimism.description>
  <MoodOffsetVeryHappy.stages.genetic_joy.label>基因喜悦</MoodOffsetVeryHappy.stages.genetic_joy.label>
  <MoodOffsetVeryHappy.stages.genetic_joy.description>“非常快乐”基因带来的天然加成。</MoodOffsetVeryHappy.stages.genetic_joy.description>
  <MoodOffsetVeryUnhappy.stages.genetic_depression.label>基因抑郁</MoodOffsetVeryUnhappy.stages.genetic_depression.label>
  <MoodOffsetVeryUnhappy.stages.genetic_depression.description>“非常不快乐”基因带来的天然惩罚。</MoodOffsetVeryUnhappy.stages.genetic_depression.description>
  <NeedLearning.stages.learningstarved.label>学习极度匮乏</NeedLearning.stages.learningstarved.label>
  <NeedLearning.stages.learningstarved.description>我已经太久没学到新东西了。我厌倦了这种单调！</NeedLearning.stages.learningstarved.description>
  <NeedLearning.stages.learningdeprived.label>学习匮乏</NeedLearning.stages.learningdeprived.label>
  <NeedLearning.stages.learningdeprived.description>我想了解更多种类的事物。这地方太无聊了！</NeedLearning.stages.learningdeprived.description>
  <NeedLearning.stages.learning_unfulfilled.label>学习未满足</NeedLearning.stages.learning_unfulfilled.label>
  <NeedLearning.stages.learning_unfulfilled.description>我需要更多学习的机会和更多学习的时间。</NeedLearning.stages.learning_unfulfilled.description>
  <NeedLearning.stages.learning_satisfied.label>学习满足</NeedLearning.stages.learning_satisfied.label>
  <NeedLearning.stages.learning_satisfied.description>我最近学到了很多！我期待学到更多。</NeedLearning.stages.learning_satisfied.description>
  <NeedLearning.stages.learning_fully_satisfied.label>学习完全满足</NeedLearning.stages.learning_fully_satisfied.label>
  <NeedLearning.stages.learning_fully_satisfied.description>我学到了好多！我爱所有这些新体验。</NeedLearning.stages.learning_fully_satisfied.description>
  <NeedPlay.stages.desperately_wants_to_play.label>极度想玩</NeedPlay.stages.desperately_wants_to_play.label>
  <NeedPlay.stages.desperately_wants_to_play.description>陪我。玩。现在！</NeedPlay.stages.desperately_wants_to_play.description>
  <PregnancyTerminated.stages.pregnancy_terminated-0.label>怀孕被终止</PregnancyTerminated.stages.pregnancy_terminated-0.label>
  <PregnancyTerminated.stages.pregnancy_terminated-0.description>我的怀孕被终止了。</PregnancyTerminated.stages.pregnancy_terminated-0.description>
  <PregnancyTerminated.stages.pregnancy_terminated-1.label>怀孕被终止</PregnancyTerminated.stages.pregnancy_terminated-1.label>
  <PregnancyTerminated.stages.pregnancy_terminated-1.description>我的怀孕被终止了。</PregnancyTerminated.stages.pregnancy_terminated-1.description>
  <PregnancyTerminated.stages.pregnancy_terminated-2.label>怀孕被终止</PregnancyTerminated.stages.pregnancy_terminated-2.label>
  <PregnancyTerminated.stages.pregnancy_terminated-2.description>我的怀孕被终止了。</PregnancyTerminated.stages.pregnancy_terminated-2.description>

